# Static Checks After Edit

After making any changes to Python files (`src/**` or `tests/**`):
1. Run `make lint` to verify Ruff lint rules and `lint-waits`.
2. Run `make typecheck` to verify `mypy --strict`.
3. Fix any reported lint or typing errors immediately before committing or marking a task done.
